<p>Your mucus is brought to near sentience.</p><p>Each turn, there is a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100,<br>mindpower 100">29%, 33%, 35%, 37%, 38%</acronym> chance that a random spot of your mucus will spawn a Mucus Ooze.</p><p>Mucus Oozes last <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns and will attack any of your foes by spitting slime at them.</p><p>You may have up to <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Cunning 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>mindpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">1, 1, 3, 4, 5</acronym> Mucus Oozes active at any time (based on your Cunning).</p><p>Any time you deal a mental critical, the remaining time on all of your Mucus Oozes will increase by 2.</p><p>The spawn chance increases with your Mindpower.</p>